From 8491ec694c29772a73aef2b21e890395534c9a11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qiyinxi <qiyinxi@foxmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:07:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 76/95] MAS local: keep the full toolbar close path unchanged

The lean-toolbar series dropped the upstream close routing in closeEvent and
slot_requestClose for every toolbar. Restore it when ANDROID_EMU_FULL_TOOLBAR=1
so the full toolbar behaves as before; the lean toolbar keeps console and
main-loop exits immediate. Also limit the safe-shutdown cleanup, the window-flag
change check, the All Apps shortcut and the snapshot dialog parent to the lean
or in-window navigation paths.

Change-Id: I1c35f880ef598c53d18f0fe8c80aa3ff95cf3b89
---
 .../android/skin/qt/emulator-qt-window.cpp    | 19 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../src/android/skin/qt/tool-window.cpp       |  7 +++++--
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/android/android-ui/modules/aemu-ui-qt/src/android/skin/qt/emulator-qt-window.cpp b/android/android-ui/modules/aemu-ui-qt/src/android/skin/qt/emulator-qt-window.cpp
